 "summary": "First Co. water-source heat pumps can ship with a CB900 DDC controller that speaks BACnet MS/TP/IP and Modbus RTU/TCP. The Modbus side exposes pressure-switch, condensate, call-signal and compressor bits plus the operating code, machine mode and software version. This map lists those status points.",
